s=i.wg(b,e,'PowerNews ("we", "our", or "the app") provides high-voltage power transmission, tariff regulations, and renewable energy market intelligence. We are committed to transparency and the highest standards of data privacy. We operate on a strict Data-Minimization and Offline-First principle.',B.n0,g,c,d,"1. Overview & Data Philosophy")
r=i.wg(b,e,"\u2022 Offline Storage: News articles, search histories, and custom bookmarks are stored locally on your device in a private SQLite database (powernews_offline.db).\n\u2022 Optional Account Sync: If you voluntarily sign in via Google Auth or Email, your user profile ID, email, and bookmarks are synchronized with Cloud Firestore.\n\u2022 Location (Optional): Used strictly on-device to filter regional state DISCOM tariffs and local solar tenders. Your precise GPS coordinates are never uploaded to our servers or sold to data brokers.\n\u2022 Telemetry: Non-identifying application performance and crash telemetry to ensure zero layout overflows and high uptime.",B.O8,g,c,d,"2. Information We Collect & Use")
q=i.wg(b,e,"\u2022 Google Cloud Functions 2nd Gen & Firebase: Serverless backend API processing with enterprise-grade encryption in transit (HTTPS/TLS 1.3).\n\u2022 Google Cloud Firestore: Secure Native database (asia-south1) protected by strict Principle of Least Privilege and IAM role boundaries.\n\u2022 Google Gemini AI: Synthesizes 50-100 word executive power briefs strictly grounded in publisher reports without personal user data ingestion.",B.tc,g,c,d,"3. Backend & Cloud Infrastructure")
p=i.wg(b,e,"PowerNews honors all original journalistic work. Every synthesized executive brief links directly to the publisher's canonical URL. We do not circumvent paywalls or reproduce full copyrighted articles without authorization. Publishers may contact us anytime for feed management or opt-outs.",B.fh,g,c,d,"4. Google Play Compliance & Attribution")
